oPodSync is a minimalist self-hosted podcast synchronization server,
compatible with the GPodder and NextCloud gPodder Sync APIs.

It allows tracking which podcast episodes have been listened to and
syncing subscriptions across devices. Requires PHP 7.4+ and SQLite3.

Compatible clients include AntennaPod, gPodder, and Kasts.

WWW: https://github.com/kd2org/opodsync
